{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HCFkCFJAGkYh8K3NnevLoE","type":"tool_result","content":"# Reviewer Scoring Rubric for CoRL 2024\n\nBased on the provided page content, **no reviewer scoring rubric is actually present**. The document titled \"Instruction for Reviews\" contains:\n\n- Review criteria focusing on \"significance and novelty of results\"\n- Desk rejection guidelines (formatting, anonymity, scope)\n- Reviewer qualification standards\n\nHowever, it does **not include**:\n- Numerical rating scales (1-10, 1-5, etc.)\n- Specific score definitions\n- Overall recommendation categories (Accept/Reject/etc.)\n- Any quantitative evaluation dimensions\n\nThe document only states that submissions will be evaluated on \"significance and novelty,\" degree of \"objective establishment,\" \"potential for scientific and technological impact,\" and \"relevance to robotic learning\"—but without accompanying numerical scales or rating labels.\n\n**Recommendation**: Check the actual review form or submission system portal for CoRL 2024, as the scoring rubric would typically be implemented there rather than in this instruction page."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eee2ebdf-357f-4a4d-85c6-2bc7a2b292e5","uuid":"ed82158b-94bb-4c6f-9ef0-23bc46c83549","timestamp":"2026-05-25T05:57:05.046Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":134134,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Reviewer Scoring Rubric for CoRL 2024\n\nBased on the provided page content, **no reviewer scoring rubric is actually present**. The document titled \"Instruction for Reviews\" contains:\n\n- Review criteria focusing on \"significance and novelty of results\"\n- Desk rejection guidelines (formatting, anonymity, scope)\n- Reviewer qualification standards\n\nHowever, it does **not include**:\n- Numerical rating scales (1-10, 1-5, etc.)\n- Specific score definitions\n- Overall recommendation categories (Accept/Reject/etc.)\n- Any quantitative evaluation dimensions\n\nThe docu