{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vve8ciSpTwWuyX4dGQ1x7B","type":"tool_result","content":"# Reviewer Scoring Rubric for CoRL 2023\n\nBased on the provided content, **no specific numerical scoring rubric with defined scales is detailed**. \n\nThe guidelines mention evaluation dimensions:\n\n- **Originality**: \"Are the problems or methods new?\"\n- **Quality**: \"Is the submission technically sound?\"\n- **Clarity**: \"Is the submission clearly written?\"\n- **Significance**: \"Are the results important?\"\n- **Relevance**: \"Does the paper address a problem in robot learning?\"\n- **Limitations**: Assessment of honestly reported limitations\n\nHowever, the document does not specify:\n- Numerical scales (e.g., 1-5, 1-10)\n- Score meanings or thresholds\n- Overall recommendation categories\n\nThe material emphasizes constructive feedback and substantiated evaluation rather than prescribing exact numerical ratings. Reviewers would receive \"technical instructions by Email via the OpenReview system,\" suggesting the actual scoring interface and scales are communicated separately from this public guidelines document."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eee2ebdf-357f-4a4d-85c6-2bc7a2b292e5","uuid":"9c9dae3c-2b2f-47ff-917e-006907e3ce84","timestamp":"2026-05-25T05:57:06.420Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":105095,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Reviewer Scoring Rubric for CoRL 2023\n\nBased on the provided content, **no specific numerical scoring rubric with defined scales is detailed**. \n\nThe guidelines mention evaluation dimensions:\n\n- **Originality**: \"Are the problems or methods new?\"\n- **Quality**: \"Is the submission technically sound?\"\n- **Clarity**: \"Is the submission clearly written?\"\n- **Significance**: \"Are the results important?\"\n- **Relevance**: \"Does the paper address a problem in robot learning?\"\n- **Limitations**: Assessment of honestly reported limitations\n\nHowever, the document does no