{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KuSDCRyQb9cH2v2Q9qUaP4","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2025 2024 acceptance rate review scores openreview \"overall score\" rating\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"Best Reviewers Award for 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC11955497/\"},{\"title\":\"The AI Review Lottery: Widespread AI-Assisted Peer Reviews Boost Paper   Scores and Acceptance Rates\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.02150\"},{\"title\":\"What Drives Paper Acceptance? A Process-Centric Analysis of Modern Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.25701\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"An Open Review of OpenReview: A Critical Analysis of the Machine   Learning Conference Review Process\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2010.05137\"},{\"title\":\"Tribute to Our Reviewers 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC11909700/\"}]\n\nThe search results show general information about OpenReview and peer review processes, but don't contain specific details about CoRL 2025's acceptance rate, review scores, or overall ratings. Let me search more specifically for CoRL 2024 acceptance rate information.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"USC at the Conference of Robot Learning (CoRL) 2024 - USC Viterbi | School of Engineering\",\"url\":\"https://viterbischool.usc.edu/news/2024/11/usc-at-the-conference-of-robot-learning-corl-2024/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"Conference on Robot Learning on X: \\\"#CoRL got 671 submissions this year. This is huge! See below for the development. 👇 (this number is already without obvious desk rejections) https://t.co/HfrSQ2ILyO\\\" / X\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/corl_conf/status/1801514565236076868\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate: Statistics of acceptance rate for the main robotics conference · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate\"},{\"title\":\"The AI Review Lottery: Widespread AI-Assisted Peer Reviews Boost Paper   Scores and Acceptance Rates\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.02150\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - lixin4ever/Conference-Acceptance-Rate: Acceptance rates for the major AI conferences · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/lixin4ever/conference-acceptance-rate\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12056528/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found some relevant information about CoRL 2024:\n\nCoRL 2024 received 671 submissions, and the oral track had an acceptance rate of only 6.6%. However, I should note that the 6.6% figure refers specifically to the oral presentation track, which is typically a more selective subset of accepted papers.\n\nUnfortunately, the search results don't contain detailed information about:\n- The overall acceptance rate across all paper types (oral + poster + workshop papers)\n- Specific review scores or \"overall score\" ratings from OpenReview\n- Detailed review statistics for CoRL 2025\n\nFor more comprehensive review statistics including overall scores and acceptance rates across all categories, you would need to visit the OpenReview pages directly:\n- CoRL 2025 Conference on OpenReview\n- CoRL