{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rb1VQAh8PwTRs8fXodrpyE","type":"tool_result","content":"# CoRL 2024 Statistics Summary\n\n**Acceptance Rate:** 39.34%\n\n**Total Submissions:** 671\n\n**Accepted Papers:** 264\n\n**Review Score Statistics:**\n- **Rating Scale:** 1.70 to 4.00\n- **Average Score:** 3.01\n- **Standard Deviation:** 0.37\n\nThe data shows that approximately 40% of submissions were accepted at CoRL 2024. All accepted papers were designated as posters, with no oral presentations listed in the available statistics. The review scores clustered relatively tightly around the mean, as indicated by the modest standard deviation of 0.37 on the 4-point scale."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eee2ebdf-357f-4a4d-85c6-2bc7a2b292e5","uuid":"38883bc6-8381-4624-9743-c3666ef71043","timestamp":"2026-05-25T05:57:30.977Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":222526,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# CoRL 2024 Statistics Summary\n\n**Acceptance Rate:** 39.34%\n\n**Total Submissions:** 671\n\n**Accepted Papers:** 264\n\n**Review Score Statistics:**\n- **Rating Scale:** 1.70 to 4.00\n- **Average Score:** 3.01\n- **Standard Deviation:** 0.37\n\nThe data shows that approximately 40% of submissions were accepted at CoRL 2024. All accepted papers were designated as posters, with no oral presentations listed in the available statistics. The review scores clustered relatively tightly around the mean, as indicated by the modest standard deviation of 0.37 on the 4-point scale.","durationMs":3185,"url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/"}}
