v_bridge_baseline |\\\\n| D206 | 2026-05-24 | D206: Importance margin is k-dependent — only stro | eval_pi05_l2norm_k09_long_seed42_postfix_v2, eval_pi05_l2norm_k07_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_l2norm_k05_long_seed42_postfix |\\\\n| D205 | 2026-05-24 | Spatial Random k=0.3 postfix = 43.4%. 全 4 suite ×  | eval_pi05_random_k03_spatial_seed42_postfix_v2 |\\\\n| D204 | 2026-05-24 | Long Random disruption curve complete (6/6). k=0.3 | eval_pi05_random_k09_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k03_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k095_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k085_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k07_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k05_long_seed42_postfix |\\\\n| D203 | 2026-05-24 | D203: L2norm k=0.95 Goal = 90.8%，低于 baseline (96.4 | eval_pi05_l2norm_k095_goal_seed42_postfix |\\\\n| D202 | 2026-05-24 | D202: Disruption peak 位置非固定——Spatial peak 在 k=0.90 | eval_pi05_random_k09_spatial_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k085_spatial_seed42_postfix_v2 |\\\\n| D201 | 2026-05-24 | D201: Goal Random post-fix curve complete (6/6) —  | eval_pi05_random_k095_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k09_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k085_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k07_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k05_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k03_goal_seed42_postfix |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4707, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AUp3Nsv9YThLt77VqxA9Ds","session_id":"eee2ebdf-357f-4a4d-85c6-2bc7a2b292e5","uuid":"1cb16dad-c7c0-41d6-8c16-39da84e85560","timestamp":"2026-05-25T06:04:05.811Z"}
