{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XWjwc9xyYNn2A4EGMcYPrP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 211\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：SmolVLA+LoRA on LIBERO-Object，Baseline vs IMM 对照，验证 Δ_k 提升和 top-k\\\\n    稳定性\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设是 margin maximization 能改善 compression robustness。用最小实验（单 suite、单\\\\n    compression method、两个条件）快速验证因果关系，再决定是否投入完整实验矩阵。CoRL DDL 紧（11天），必须尽快拿到 MVP 信号。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 4 项 warning：ACIS scoring for pruning、Lipschitz 监控、kill path、λ\\\\n    warmup\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出：(1) pruning 应用 ACIS scores 而非 FastV attention 以保证逻辑自洽；(2)\\\\n    certified bound 依赖 L 和 Δ_k 两者，需监控 L·ε/Δ_k ratio；(3) 需定义超参搜索范围和 kill criteria 避免盲目投入；(4)\\\\n    ACIS 依赖 action head 中间表示，训练早期不稳定需 λ warmup。全部合理，纳入 MVP 设计。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: L·ε/Δ_k gate criteria 量化：ratio 下降 ≥30%（相对 baseline）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出其余 3 项 gate criteria 有量化标准但 L·ε/Δ_k 只写\\\\\\\"下降\\\\\\\"，可能出现 Δ_k 涨但 L 同步涨导致\\\\n    ratio 不变的模糊情况。设 ≥30% 下降作为 MVP 粗阈值，足以区分信号。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 增加 k=96 (75% retention) 条件；soft top-k 升级为 implicit differentiation\\\\n    方法\\\\n  rationale: SmolVLA pixel shuffle 后仅 128 tokens total，50% pruning (k=64) 可能过于激进导致\\\\n    false negative。增加 75% retention 对照避免因 pruning ratio 误判核心假设。Soft top-k 原实现不保证 Σp_i=k，梯度有偏，架构报告推荐的\\\\n    implicit differentiation 方法更精确，对 LoRA fine-tuning 稳定性更好。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 数据集从 LIBERO-Object 换为 lerobot 原生可用数据集（候选：aloha_sim_insertion/pusht/xarm_lift）\\\\n  rationale: lerobot/libero_object_no_noops 返回 401 RepositoryNotFoundError，确认不存在。已在数据集问题上浪费多个\\\\n    Worker 和数小时 GPU 空闲时间。MVP 核心假设（margin maximization → top-k stability）不依赖特定数据集，换用\\\\n    lerobot 确认可用的数据集不影响验证。LIBERO 留到 research 阶段通过自定义 dataset adapter 接入。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dry-run 必须同时覆盖 train 和 eval 模式，token_selection.py _hard_forward bug 只在\\\\n    eval 触发\\\\n  rationale: mvp_imm_anchor_v5 在 step 2000 首次 eval 时崩溃：_hard_forward() 中 threshold_low.squeeze(-1)\\\\n    将 (B,1) 变成 (B,) 无法与 (B,N) 广播。此 bug 在 training 模式下不触发（走 _soft_forward），之前所有 dry-run\\\\n    只测了 training step。教训：任何 dry-run 必须同时在 model.train() 和 model.eval() 两种模式下各跑一步。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v5\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: crashed at step 2000 during eval\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Gate Criteria #3 从 \\\\\\\"action_loss 不降 >5%\\\\\\\" 放宽为 \\\\\\\"IMM/baseline 均值比 ≤1.10\\\\\\\"，避免\\\\n    flow matching 噪声误判'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 flow matching loss 稳定在 ~0.01 量级时，5% 相对阈值 = 0.0005 绝对差异，在\\\\n    batch-level 噪声范围内。放宽到 10% 相对阈值，用 eval batches 均值比较，足以检测 IMM 对 action quality 的实质性损害而不被噪声误触。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: loss ~0.001-0.035 at step 9700\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: IMM 训练跳过训练内 eval (eval_every=999999)，用独立 evaluate.py 做全量评估\\\\n  rationale: IMM v6 在 step 2000 eval 再次崩溃，根因是 lerobot 内部 RoPE position embedding 维度不匹配（50\\\\n    vs 82），非我们代码 bug。修复 lerobot 内部代码耗时且脆弱，而独立 evaluate.py 已修复验证通过。跳过训练内 eval 可立即重启，通过\\\\n    train_loss + gradient + margin_loss 监控训练健康。save_every 从 5000 改为 2000 作为 fallback。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v6\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: crashed at step 2000 during eval - lerobot RoPE bug\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: _hard_forward 改为 binary mask 保持序列长度（方案 C），不物理删除 tokens，避免 prefix 长度不匹配\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 定位 v6 crash 真因：_hard_forward 返回 (B, k, D) 但 tokens_per_cam 仍为\\\\n    [64]，_build_prefix_with_vis_tokens 构建的 embs/pad 长度不一致导致 RoPE position_ids 82 vs\\\\n    query 50。方案 C 最安全：eval 模式用 binary 0/1 mask 乘以 tokens，输出 (B, N, D) 与 _soft_forward\\\\n    一致，不改变序列结构，兼容所有下游长度假设。merge 逻辑暂时去掉（post-MVP 恢复为保持序列长度的版本）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v6\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: crashed at step 2000 - prefix length mismatch from _hard_forward physical\\\\n      token removal\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Gate Criteria comparison protocol: Gates #1/#2/#4 用 IMM step_002000 checkpoint\\\\n    作参照（ACIS 几乎未训练），Gate #3 用 baseline_v5 final action_loss；L 值用 L_empirical'\\\\n  rationale: 'Baseline 无 ACIS 模块，无法直接计算 Δ_k/preservation/ratio。IMM step_002000 是最早可用\\\\n    checkpoint，且 lambda warmup 期间 margin_loss 权重极低，ACIS 几乎未被有效训练，可作为\\\\\\\"训练前\\\\\\\"参照。Gate #3\\\\n    直接用 baseline_v5 clean_loss=0.00422。Gate #4 的 L 值用 L_empirical（power iteration,\\\\n    0.096）作为主要指标，L_spectral（1.067）作为保守上界在报告中标注——spectral norm 包含了不影响 visual token\\\\n    scoring 的层（query_proj/q_proj），过于保守。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: treatment\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D011: evaluate.py baseline 路径必须修复——扰动/剪枝未实际应用'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: evaluate.py 在 imm_enabled=False 时跳过 perturb_images()\\\\n    和 pruning，baseline_v5 的 eps>0 / prune=True 结果全部无效（仅反映 flow matching 随机采样方差）。证据：eps=0.02\\\\n    loss < eps=0.0 loss，违反单调性。修复前仅 eps0.0_pruneFalse (0.00422) 可引用。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: eps>0 和 prune=True 结果无效\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Gate D003 的 l_eps_delta_ratio 改用 median（非 mean），mean 被 tail 极端值严重扭曲\\\\n  rationale: Step 4000 eval 显示 ratio mean 从 1.218→1.762 恶化，但 median 从 0.193→0.165\\\\n    实际改善。mean 被极端 token 拉偏（eps0.05+prune 条件下 mean=33.62 vs median 远低于此）。Median 更能反映\\\\n    typical token 的鲁棒性改善，用于 gate 判定更合理。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'step 4000: ratio_mean 1.762 (恶化) vs ratio_median 0.165 (改善)'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7 Lipschitz 爆炸：不 kill 但设 step 8000 kill 条件；cuda:0 立即启动 v7.1 (lambda=0.2,\\\\n    grad_clip=30)\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 报告 v7 step 6000 的 lipschitz_empirical 从 0.096 指数增长到 0.606，Gate\\\\n    D003 的 L·ε/Δ_k ratio 上升 221% 而非下降 30%。根因: lambda_margin=0.5 太激进。决策: (1) v7 继续到\\\\n    step 8000 收集数据但设 kill 条件 (L>1.0 / grad>100 / median ratio>1.0)；(2) cuda:0 空闲违反资源纪律，立即启动\\\\n    v7.1 用更保守超参 (lambda=0.2, grad_clip=30) 并行探索。这符合 kill path 协议的超参搜索流程。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: 触发\\\\n    result: Lipschitz 爆炸, D003 完全失败\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_1\\\\n    role: 修正实验\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill v7.1 (eval mode leak bug)，修复 metrics.py 后重启为 v7.2 (同配置)\\\\n  rationale: v7.1 的 LIP_MONITOR 代码调用 acis.eval() 未恢复 train mode，导致 spectral norm power\\\\n    iteration 停止，SN 从 1.014 飙到 4.617。step 500 起训练数据无效。修复是一行代码（恢复 training mode），v7.2\\\\n    用修复后的代码重启，配置不变。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_1\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: eval mode leak 导致 spectral norm 失控\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: 修正重启\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: G4 改为 IMM LED 绝对阈值（median < 1.0），不再与 baseline 做 relative comparison\\\\n  rationale: Baseline 无 ACIS 机制，Lipschitz 常数 L=0，LED ratio=0，relative decrease 无意义。Reviewer\\\\n    建议 (b) 方案：改为绝对阈值。LED = L·ε·k/Δ_k < 1.0 意味着 certified bound 成立（扰动不超过 margin），这是\\\\n    IMM 的核心理论目标。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: eval_target\\\\n    result: running_eval\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: L=0 无法比较\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7 MVP Gate FAIL (G3=3.28x)；不修订 G3 定义；v7.2 为决定性实验；pruning 鲁棒性数据留作论文素材\\\\n  rationale: v7 (lambda=0.5) G1/G2/G4 大幅通过但 G3 严重失败 (3.28x vs ≤1.10)。Reviewer 建议增加\\\\n    G3b (pruned scenario gate)，拒绝——mid-evaluation 修改 gate 定义会损害 MVP 评估的诚信度。clean performance\\\\n    是合理的硬约束：一个主任务退化 3.28x 的模型即使 pruning 鲁棒也不可接受。但 Reviewer 揭示的 pruning 数据极有价值：(1)\\\\n    IMM prune50% 仅增 8% loss vs baseline 增 2816%；(2) baseline 训练越久 pruning 越脆弱 (4.4x→9.7x→29.2x)。这些作为论文素材保留。v7.2\\\\n    (lambda=\\\\n\\\\n... [截断: 省略 166628 字符，传 max_chars=0 获取完整内容]\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 174628, \\\"truncated\\\": true}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AUp3Nsv9YThLt77VqxA9Ds","session_id":"eee2ebdf-357f-4a4d-85c6-2bc7a2b292e5","uuid":"89a78b8b-ea69-4ce7-865a-0acfd3349734","timestamp":"2026-05-25T06:04:30.820Z"}
